{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e5a9abaee343819ee70315fd4366b5642ab7732302010e9faff3efd8712818c8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53efed3b9bc4b4a28b85c873af72320926b5c065db2c37c28211e225967129d5",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，早上好。\n昨天的万圣节游行大获成功呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b060213ee5ebb4262c148a9d10e3eb8bb1b7f7a60270d83b0fb13b95d8dbaa2",
      "text": "游行的样子，电视上稍微播了一点呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a74ab989b5786afa7c87d6a3c3ffe223b19c1c86297987764942245fdfefe653",
      "text": "前来参加的客人们，大家看起来都特别开心。\n要是能成为一段美好的回忆就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5383ae7ea91bc12deb43878e1ac028e14f0281940836784bf18f6e84ea9acf0",
      "text": "肯定成为了一段难忘的\n回忆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036b99d4a12643ad834f86104555bd39ed3eec81b6512a94330c48bc7bbb915c",
      "text": "一定成为了一个最棒的\n万圣节哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75af52773a89dc2091c3227c1a4d748d4451ecc1376962154f7121e8f7b4bc68",
      "text": "是啊，能得到你这样的肯定，\n大概就不会有错了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ffae9891617bb6ec544111423ac613c6755e3fd752b7549ebb90f8dd92b4080",
      "text": "对我来说，这次的万圣节也成了最棒的回忆啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:011min_402_2_4_011_02_09_a:2_4_011_02_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3907c786b00e13ad6ccbab0ef78693a501712880c71bc57016ff258b2def68c",
      "text": "那么，今天的工作也一起加油吧。\n回头见，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
